        "model.layers.{L}.mlp.shared_experts.down_proj.weight",
        "model.norm.weight",
        "lm_head.weight"
      ],
      "notes": "Header/index and CK tensor-role mapping contract for AMD Instella-MoE. Layer 0 is dense, so MoE families are required only on MoE layers; the index auditor validates presence and per-layer expert counts. The circuit lowers gated MLA, FarSkip two-stream lifetimes, and a map-owned contiguous-position YaRN initializer through generated C. Real-weight PyTorch X-ray parity remains the release gate beyond config-level support."
